{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And you shall be brought low.</b> The meaning concerns the words of Hezekiah's envoys to Rabshakeh." "<b>From the ground you shall speak.</b> As though you speak from beneath the ground." "<b>Like an 'ob.</b> Like וכאובות חדשים (Job 32:19), for such is their craft."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:55:44.601317438Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}